1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,040
[SILENCE]

2
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,000
[SPEAKER_01] And is there a Google Station for the journalist?

3
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,800
[SPEAKER_01] When do they stay where, what do they do?

4
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,880
[SPEAKER_01] No, no, I won't return tonight,
it will be late, morning already.

5
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,880
[SILENCE]

6
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,150
[SPEAKER_01] I told you I will come in the morning.

7
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,300
[SPEAKER_01] You are here?

8
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:25,880
[SPEAKER_01] Alright, hang up.

9
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:28,050
[BACKGROUND MUSIC PLAYING]

10
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,200
[SPEAKER_01] Searching for me while walking.

11
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,200
[SPEAKER_01] Tell me, what happened at the station?

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,800
[SPEAKER_02] Sir, a VIP accident case has arrived,
calls are coming from the Ministry.

13
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,500
[SPEAKER_01] Ministry official? Whose car?
Where is the driver?

14
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
[POLICE SIREN WAILING]

15
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:46,200
[SPEAKER_02] The driver was on the spot sir,
the public caught and beat him.

16
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,800
[SPEAKER_01] Get the medical report first.
Send to the hospital immediately.

17
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,200
[SPEAKER_03] OC Harun sahib, this case is
very sensitive, please handle carefully.

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,900
[DOOR CREAKING OPEN]

19
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:03,800
[SPEAKER_01] Sensitive indeed. But before the law
everyone is equal, right?

20
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,400
[SPEAKER_02] Sir, the boy's father is an influential businessman,
the media has arrived outside.

21
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:14,500
[SPEAKER_01] Tell the media to wait 5 minutes.
No statement right now.

22
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:19,800
[PHONE RINGING PERSISTENTLY]

23
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:24,600
[SPEAKER_01] Hello Commissioner sir? Yes sir,
I am investigating personally.

24
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:29,200
[SPEAKER_01] Bail petition goes to court tomorrow morning,
he stays in lock-up tonight.

25
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
[TENSE SILENCE]

26
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,800
[SPEAKER_02] Sir, remand paperwork is ready.
Need your signature.

27
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,500
[SPEAKER_01] Signing it. But keep the record clean,
make sure there are no mistakes.

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,800
[CAR TIRES SCREECHING]

29
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:54,500
[SPEAKER_03] Harun bhai, pressure is coming from above.
This case needs to be covered up.

30
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:59,800
[SPEAKER_01] Covering it up isn't so simple.
Everything is clear on CCTV footage.

31
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,000
[HEAVY RAIN POURING]

32
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,500
[SPEAKER_02] Sir, the victim is in the ICU,
the doctor said condition is critical.

33
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:15,800
[SPEAKER_01] Tell their family to arrange blood.
The station will provide all help.

34
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
[SUSPENSEFUL SCORE]

35
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:28,000
[SPEAKER_01] As night deepens in the metropolis,
the mystery grows deeper.

36
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[SPEAKER_02] Only four hours left until morning sir.
Will we succeed?

37
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,500
[SPEAKER_01] We must succeed.
Now that I've taken charge, I'll see it through.

38
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:50,000
[PROLONGED SILENCE]

39
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:56,500
[SPEAKER_01] Officer, re-check all witness statements.
There must be no loopholes.

40
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:05,000
[METROPOLITAN NIGHT THEME]

41
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:12,000
[SPEAKER_02] All files are ready sir. As soon as court opens
we will submit the chargesheet.

42
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:25,000
[CITY TRAFFIC & AMBIENT HORNS]

43
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:32,000
[SPEAKER_01] Even if the city sleeps, truth never sleeps.
Come, let the investigation begin.

44
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:50,000
[DEEP AMBIENT SILENCE]

45
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:58,000
[SPEAKER_01] The arms of the law are very long,
no matter how influential the criminal is.

46
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:15,000
[DRAMATIC CRESCENDO]

47
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:25,000
[SPEAKER_02] We are ready sir. Truth will prevail.

48
00:04:30,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING TOWARD OUTRO]
